WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.760
Last one: sending comms.

00:01.760 --> 00:03.370
Go to Comms, then Hub.

00:03.870 --> 00:06.550
Every post from Comms sends a phone alert now.

00:06.550 --> 00:10.870
To send a quick message, type it in Alert parents and tap Send to parents.

00:11.370 --> 00:14.780
When it has gone, it tells you how many phones got it,

00:14.780 --> 00:20.460
for example sent to 12 of 14 devices, and how many families have not turned alerts on yet.

00:20.970 --> 00:24.810
That count only goes up when families switch alerts on.

00:24.810 --> 00:28.790
On their home page they get a Turn on notifications card.

00:28.790 --> 00:33.890
On an iPhone they first add Touchline to the home screen, then tap Allow.

00:33.890 --> 00:39.200
Your Today page lists who has not done it yet, so you can give them a nudge.

00:39.700 --> 00:41.220
Polls work the same way.

00:41.220 --> 00:41.720
Playing?

00:41.720 --> 00:45.450
and attendance questions show on the families landing page,

00:45.450 --> 00:47.590
and the live counts show on yours.

00:48.090 --> 00:51.130
Players can ask questions with no name on them.

00:51.130 --> 00:54.240
You find them in Comms, Hub, under Player voice.

00:54.240 --> 00:55.800
You never see who asked.

00:56.300 --> 00:57.590
Type your answer.

00:57.590 --> 01:04.400
You can attach a session from the list, or paste links, one per line, with a title, a bar,

01:04.400 --> 01:05.460
then the link.

01:05.460 --> 01:09.620
Tick also post to the whole squad if it helps everyone.

01:09.620 --> 01:11.660
It still has no name on it.

01:12.160 --> 01:16.490
Tap Save answer, and it lands on the profile of the lad who asked.

01:16.490 --> 01:17.210
That is it.

01:17.210 --> 01:23.110
If something does not look right, open the How this page works box at the top of any page.
